    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostrĕārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		ostrea, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			oysters</i>, <i>oyster-</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">panis,</span>”
				<i>oyster-bread</i>, <i>bread eaten with oysters</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 11, 27, § 105</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostrĕā-rĭum</span></b> ,
			ii, n., <i>an
			oyster-bed</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 51, 74, § 160</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Baiano locare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
